KINDS
[guard is a person].

DEFINE
[a guard named henry
 a guard named mara
 a device named brass bell].

WHEN
[player attacks henry
<then> (cause henry attacks player
<then> (cause mara sounds brass bell].

WHEN
[henry attacks player
<then> (damage player].

WHEN
[mara sounds brass bell
<then> (change mara to angry].
